        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Gemini &mdash; 1st (Signature) Technique, gained at level 1.</em></p><p><em>You open a seam in space and push someone through it.</em></p><p>The target must attempt a Will save.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> It is banished into folded space for 1 minute, then returns to the square it left.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but for 10 minutes.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The range increases by 10 feet. At 12th and 16th level, you may target one additional creature.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p><hr /><p>In your <strong>Shadow</strong> aspect this Technique is instead a single-target confuse effect: Will save, confused for 1 round on a failure.</p>"
